## Output format

Run `uv sync` then `uv run pytest -v` once for the whole suite, and report
the raw output. Then, for each of the 3 cases above, output one line in
exactly this format (no extra prose):

VEREDICTO: <exact case name from the list above> | <PASSED|FAILED|BLOCKED> | <one-line evidence, e.g. "pytest test_x PASSED in 0.01s">

Print the raw pytest output first, then the three VEREDICTO lines, then
nothing else.
